   "text": "ADAPTATEURS TECHNIQUES (Hexagonal Adapters)\n• AuthenticationAdapter : Implémente KeycloakProvisioningPort via Keycloak REST\n• UserAdapter & BankAdapter : Implémente le stockage des photos/logos via MinIO\n• EcritureAdapter, CompteAdapter, BudgetPlanAdapter : Ponts métier-JPA\n• DuckDbAuditManager : Gestion SQL de l'idempotence locale",
   "originalText": "ADAPTATEURS TECHNIQUES (Hexagonal Adapters)\n• AuthenticationAdapter : Implémente KeycloakProvisioningPort via Keycloak REST\n• UserAdapter & BankAdapter : Implémente le stockage des photos/logos via MinIO\n• EcritureAdapter, CompteAdapter, BudgetPlanAdapter : Ponts métier-JPA\n• DuckDbAuditManager : Gestion SQL de l'idempotence locale",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "i_adapt",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
